body:
`...props` includes the form-renderer `schema` object when this widget is used via the registry path; spreading it onto `<Input>` forwards an object-valued `schema` attribute to the DOM. Please remove `schema` from the spread before passing props to `<Input>`.
```suggestion
  const { schema: _schema, ...inputProps } = props as any;

  return (
    <Input
      {...inputProps}
```
